## Oracle finding

Pinned Java `ProcessQueue.cleanExpiredMsg(null)` immediately invokes
`pushConsumer.isConsumeOrderly()` and throws `NullPointerException` before
inspecting the message queue. Rust now exposes `clean_expired_msg_nullable`;
`None` returns `ExpiredMessageCleanupError::NullPushConsumer` before the scan.

The Java expired-message fixture records the exception class. The Rust
comparison checks the typed error and its Java class string. Fixture SHA-256:
`2934eb15b2fb599bd6309fd8d8dc394ad0deef817060bc3883373da0942ce40c`.

